# The frontend runs standalone by DEFAULT: an in-browser knowledge engine with a real
# embedded corpus powers Ask BHUMI, Topic Intelligence and the Report Engine — no server.
# You normally need NO environment variables at all for the demo.

# Company Brain calls the API whenever NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is set.
# Set both of these so the rest of the workspace uses the same backend:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE=false
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-render-service.onrender.com
